WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.690
We're leaving now.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.530
I'm so sleepy again today...

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:10.690
You sure are.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:14.200
Tooru, you don't seem sleepy at all.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.080
I'm a morning person.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.370
That must be nice. I'm jealous.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:23.580
I'm just so bad with mornings...

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:26.630
That's...

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.750
What's wrong, Run-chan?

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.050
<i>There's something strange about those birds.</i>

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.760
<i>I wonder what happened?</i>

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:35.680
Hey, Tooru.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.350
Those birds keep going in circles. Are they okay?

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:42.350
Run-chan. That's a weather vane.

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.750
Her silky long hair!

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.460
Her cute, thin, hourglass waist!

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.970
Her arms as long as a giraffe's neck!

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:41.140
Huh? Are they arguing?

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.760
She must have more good points than that!

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.520
Her slender legs!

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.730
Better points!

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:49.480
Her voluptuous E-cups!

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:50.190
More!

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.810
Her skin that's white as tofu!

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:52.690
More!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:52.900
More more more more more more more more!

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.900
What's wrong, you two?

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.150
We're naming your good qualities!

00:02:57.690 --> 00:03:00.280
<i>H-How'd you get on that topic?</i>

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.740
Pores so small you'd need a microscope to see!

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:04.870
A tiny face like a water flea's!

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:07.620
Seems like you're only describing her appearance.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.960
<i>I wish they'd name some more internal good qualities.</i>

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:12.920
More!

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:13.960
Umm...

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.960
Her figure is to die for!

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:22.220
W-What's wrong, Tooru?

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:23.640
Run-chan...

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:27.180
Run-chan keeps giving Yuuko all the praise.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:31.390
I got so caught up in the moment that I shot myself in the foot.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.150
That's not true.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:35.310
Tooru, I'm sure you have good qualities, too!

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.150
Like?

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:38.860
Huh?

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.070
Um, that is...

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:41.990
That's right!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.030
There are people who are "moé" for f-flat chests.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.330
You know, slender is in style!

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.830
That's your target audience, Tooru!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.670
W-What?

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.800
S-Stop it!

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:04.840
What's so great about a nice body?

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.930
You look like a model, Yuuko-chan!

00:04:09.020 --> 00:04:10.600
<i>I forgot!</i>

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:13.810
<i>My goal for this year:</i>

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.980
<i>lose two or three kilograms by summer, and look like a model!</i>

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.400
<i>No, wait. I still have time.</i>

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.990
<i>Summer doesn't really start until August.</i>

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.360
<i>The high school girl's summer has yet to begin!</i>

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.080
<i>One more month.</i>

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.330
<i>One more month to do something about this!</i>

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:32.910
Hey...

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.470
<i>Nagi, you idiot.</i>

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.510
<i>I forgot something else.</i>

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:48.970
<i>A high school girl's summer starts today!</i>

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:55.440
Making us change into swimsuits just to clean the pool...

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.940
It's so inconvenient.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:05.240
But it sounds like fun to do the cleaning in swimsuits!

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:07.820
Right? Don't you agree, Nagi-chan?

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.120
What's wrong, Nagi-chan?

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.540
N-Nothing at all.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.630
<i>It's tight...</i>

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.420
<i>Don't tell me I gained weight?</i>

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:24.420
<i>No, it couldn't possibly...</i>

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.590
Did our swimsuits shrink?

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.220
Mine feels a bit tight.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:30.350
We're still growing!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:31.510
In various places.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.600
S-Stop it, gosh.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.140
<i>I see!</i>

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.100
<i>My swimsuit shrunk!</i>

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:41.860
Don't you think Nagi's acting strange today?

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.490
Huh? She's the same as always.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:02.040
Tooru-san!

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:03.800
Making progress?

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:05.170
Ah.

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.720
You're Yutaka's friend.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.470
Call me Miho.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:12.140
Actually, just like Yutaka,

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.510
I'm a fan of yours.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:16.270
<i>Fan?</i>

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:17.180
Anyway,

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.610
I never got the chance to ask, but

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:23.400
there's something I've been wondering about.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.280
So soft!

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.370
Is this natural? Do you style it?

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.240
It's natural...

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:37.540
Toooooruuun!

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:39.250
No fair, Miporin!

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.880
Miporin, you're bothering Toorun, too!

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.710
But I don't always cling to her like you do.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:47.550
It's not fair that you can touch her!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.760
Yutaka's gonna touch her, too!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:50.090
Grab!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.470
Oh, you...

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:57.060
Toorun! Toorun!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.020
By the way,

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:01.100
you two seem like good friends. Were you in the same middle school?

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:02.610
Yep.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:05.320
We've sort of been stuck together.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:11.410
<i>She keeps checking the time.</i>

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:13.660
Okay! Three minutes is up.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:14.160
Hm?

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.830
Move away from Tooru-san immediately, Yutaka.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.210
What, already?

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:21.750
Miporin, you're so mean!

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:24.000
I'm used to her,

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.170
so if Yutaka bothers you again, you can ask me for advice.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.300
Speaking of middle school,

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.260
they used to call Miporin "Remote Control".

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:34.430
Lame nickname, isn't it?

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.180
You realize where that came from, right?

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:39.140
Nope!

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:43.150
Yutaka!

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.770
I'm sorry, ma'am.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.400
So long as you understand.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.660
Tooru-san, I'll carry that trash bag for you.

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.700
Ah! Yutaka will carry it!

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.040
Well then, it's all yours.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.960
Wait up! This is heavy...

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.210
Miporin!

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.290
So heavy...

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.970
The brilliant rays of sunlight!

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.340
At the poolside!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.680
Feels like a resort?

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:22.690
Not in the least.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.610
It's way too hot.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:32.950
The inside of a pool is sure hot.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.700
Well, yeah.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.450
The heat from the sun has nowhere to escape to.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.710
In any case, let's get this over with!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.080
Yahoo!

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.090
Watch out!

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.300
What's she up to?

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.680
Dunno.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:01.430
Yuuko-chan, Nagi-chan!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.100
This place is all slippery!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.110
You're right.

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:15.610
That's dangerous!

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:18.410
What if you fell and hit your head?

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.450
It's fine, I won't!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.450
Here I go!

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:24.120
Gosh.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.000
Nagi, you tell her too-

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.180
Nagi!

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.010
What?

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.470
Yuuko-chan! Gotcha!

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.230
You're soaked!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:46.390
I see.

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:48.100
So that's how it's gonna be.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:50.940
Run!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:52.730
Got you!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.070
Hey!

00:09:55.070 --> 00:09:56.490
Take that!

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.000
Um, Toorun, what are you looking at?

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.220
Gotcha!

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:47.850
Paradise.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:51.350
This is not paradise at all.

00:11:58.820 --> 00:11:59.780
I'm back.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.960
I'm beat.

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:22.010
I should have put on more sunscreen.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.100
<i>It'll be fine.</i>

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:30.180
<i>I got a ton of exercise today.</i>

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.600
<i>I'm sure it went down.</i>

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:33.440
<i>Rather,</i>

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:37.440
<i>I may have reached my goal of three kilograms already!</i>

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.150
<i>Show me what I want, scale!</i>

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:01.090
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:04.630
<i>since I'm wearing clothes, I should just subtract one kilogram.</i>

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.470
Oh look, it hasn't changed!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:10.760
Such a letdown after all my nervousness.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:16.980
I guess I should plan out my month.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:20.440
To start with, limit your food intake and exercise a lot.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.440
Don't eat everything on your plate.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:26.450
Eat dinner early and make it small.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:29.950
Cook something with lots of vegetables and that's low in fat.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.460
Make sure to exercise daily.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:38.460
Jogging, jumping rope, and stretching are effective.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.880
Wow, sadistic.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.130
Thanks for the meal.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.850
<i>Better not tell anyone I started a diet.</i>

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.640
<i>I bet they'd make a fuss.</i>

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:57.100
<i>If Run found out...</i>

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:01.110
<i>It's bad for your health, so stop it!</i>

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.280
<i>Yuuko would...</i>

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.780
<i>You're fine the way you are!</i>

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:07.990
<i>You're just right.</i>

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:11.030
<i>Sounds like something she'd say.</i>

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.080
<i>Tooru would...</i>

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:17.460
<i>Ahh.</i>

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:19.170
<i>Mmm. Delicious.</i>

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.920
<i>Want some? You can have all you want.</i>

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:25.090
Just imagining it is making me hungry.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:30.140
Nagi.

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.600
<i>I totally spaced out!</i>

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.810
Tooru's kinda sharp, so I'd better watch out.

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.100
Hey, what's up?

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:40.100
Diet.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:43.400
What are-

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.070
Hey.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.780
You're on a diet, aren't you?

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:56.200
W-What are you talking about?

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:00.670
Where are Run and Yuuko?

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.170
They just went to the bathroom.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.170
How did you know?

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.050
This spring, didn't you say,

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:10.760
"If I diet, I can lose three kilograms by summer, no problem"?

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:13.100
You were reminded of it yesterday, weren't you?

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:16.770
You could have just forgotten a trivial thing like that.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.060
Are you going to tell the others?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:21.310
Don't plan to.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.860
Don't tell me you want a bribe to keep quiet?

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:26.860
Not really.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.490
Whah are you dohing?

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:38.950
They're not here.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:43.710
For all the sweets you eat, you sure are skinny, Tooru.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.250
It's probably because I run around so much.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:49.510
In exchange, not much growth's going on here.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.010
I see.

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:53.140
They say if you shake it, you lose it.

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:57.890
In that case, I can't jog or jump rope or I'll lose my breasts!

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.180
All right!

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:02.310
If you're that concerned,

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.100
why don't you ask Yuuko?

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:07.360
Maybe she actually goes to a lot of trouble.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.360
There must be something.

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.530
Some secret to her nice body.

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:14.160
I see.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.120
You're right!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:16.990
Okay!

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.000
They're not here, either.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.670
Maybe we just missed them somewhere.

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.920
Tooru, you're sweating!

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.510
These are tears of sadness at being unable to see Run-chan.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:33.380
Don't bluff like that.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.260
All the walking made you hot, didn't it?

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:36.430
No, it didn't.

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:40.970
Besides, it's summer already. Why the long sleeves?

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:43.520
I want to avoid exposing my arms.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:48.320
Gosh, you'll get heatstroke, so take it off!

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:51.110
Are you that against it?

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:56.160
Okay! Turn to page 52 in your textbooks.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:07.630
Huh? Am I doing anything to maintain my figure?

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.420
N-No particular reason.

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:11.800
Just felt like asking.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.260
Hmm...

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.010
Let's see...

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.800
I eat my favorite foods as much as I want,

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.560
and sleep a lot, I guess.

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:21.180
Really, I don't do anything.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.270
What are you, the ultimate model?

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.230
Don't kid me!

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:25.560
You're utterly useless!

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:26.020
Huh?

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.900
W-What?

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.650
Maintaining her figure?

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.820
You mean a diet?

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:35.650
Oh, you were talking about a diet?

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.120
Nagi, did you start a diet?

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.070
Well...

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.660
Yeah, but...

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.790
I guess the cat's out of the bag.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:44.870
Run, have you ever dieted?

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.420
Never stuck to one.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:50.540
Don't like limiting what I eat.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:52.500
Neither have you, right, Yuuko-chan?

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.510
No, I haven't. Why?

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:57.360
Because you have pets, right?

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:57.380
Pets?
Because you have pets, right?

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:58.470
Pets?

00:17:58.470 --> 00:17:59.260
What do you mean?

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:02.810
What was it again? Sounded like an office supply...

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.640
Tapeworms!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.190
You use the power of the tapeworms!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.690
I don't have any, and they aren't pets!

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:12.650
Computer.

00:18:13.030 --> 00:18:13.690
Huh?

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:17.400
You can look up some good diets online.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.660
Oh, I see.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:23.080
Why'd we come to the library?

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.660
Couldn't you use the classroom's?

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:28.670
Looking this up on the classroom computer is kinda...

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:32.250
There sure are many kinds of diets.

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:38.090
It says, "I lost 60 kg after taking this!"

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.590
That's way too much.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.510
It sounds fake.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:44.390
If I lost that much, my weight would go negative,

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:47.140
and then I could fly!

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:48.230
Sure.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:50.520
You'd become incorporeal.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:53.940
Thanks for the food.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.780
Nagi-chan, you're done already?

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:57.690
Yeah.

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:00.740
Eating less is fundamental to a diet.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.490
Don't push yourself, Nagi.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.000
I'll be fine.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.710
I can handle this much.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.590
You're pushing yourself.

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.550
Forget what just happened!

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:18.090
You didn't hear that!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:21.220
I can't do that. I definitely heard it.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.600
Forget it!

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:32.900
Man, I still get hungry by this time of day.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.070
Um, hey, Nagi.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:40.490
Jumping right into a tough diet is bad for you, so you should stop.

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:41.950
Take it slowly.

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:45.830
In fact, just make it your goal for next year instead.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:50.910
She's right, Nagi-chan!

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.790
Just take it easy.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:54.960
I guess you're right.

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.750
I can't push myself.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:59.800
I'll stop rushing and go at my own pace.

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:00.720
Right, right!

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:01.970
Oh yeah!

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.720
Want to go for ice cream?

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:05.390
I like the sound of that!

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:06.930
Now wait just a minute here!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:09.680
Isn't ice cream a bit out of place in this conversation?

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:12.690
I want chocolate chip and strawberry!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:16.440
Vanilla, and cheese, and yogurt.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:18.020
They're all white!

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:19.150
Like I said-

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:22.700
I'm thinking of getting mint and raspberry.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:23.570
What about you, Nagi?

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.000
Rum raisin.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:40.010
Guess I won't be dieting any time soon.

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:41.590
Come on, let's go!

00:20:41.590 --> 00:20:42.470
Nagi!

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.300
Ah, hold on-

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:47.930
You're fine just the way you are!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:49.850
Huh?

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.100
Nagi, you're just right the way you are.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.850
You're plenty cute!

00:20:56.560 --> 00:21:00.320
What kind of embarrassing line is that?

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:01.150
Geez!

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:03.900
Wait up, Yuuko!

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.490
Come on, hurry up!

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:06.990
I said wait up!

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:23.630
Take a look!

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:25.510
Brand new socks!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:27.970
Fluorescent yellow!

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:29.640
Those will stand out.

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:30.890
Aren't they something?

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.140
Good morning!

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:33.390
Morning!

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:35.100
Tooru!

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:37.690
Why are you wearing loose socks?

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:38.860
In this day and age...

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:41.900
Uh-uh, these are new knee-socks.

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:43.820
They just fall down easily.

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:45.400
How skinny are you?

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.790
Even though they have stoppers, they keep slipping.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.710
Want some sock glue?

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:00.210
Sure.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:03.760
I wish I was just a bit chubbier.

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:06.340
I just heard something I can't let slide!

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:07.680
I said nothing.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:09.970
Okay. Done.

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:11.560
Thank you.

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:20.730
I wish I was chubbier.

00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:59.080
It's really summer now!

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:01.870
Summer means the pool, and the beach!

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:03.250
We're at the beach!

00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:05.540
And the beach means swimsuits everywhere!

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:07.340
Can't get enough!

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:09.380
Are you really a high school girl?

00:24:09.380 --> 00:24:13.130
I'm sure you're all dying to see Yutaka in a swimsuit!

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:14.300
I don't think so.

00:24:14.300 --> 00:24:15.930
Next time on A-Channel!

00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:16.600
"Beach"!

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:20.310
But Yutaka's only dying to see Toorun in a swimsuit!

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:21.850
Ah, me too, me too!

00:24:21.850 --> 00:24:23.440
What, no comeback?
